          "name": "Target",
          "type": "FSlotBase*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "TSharedPtr<SWidget>",
      "docs": "Remove the widget from its current slot.\nThe removed widget is returned so that operations could be performed on it.\nIf the null widget was being stored, an invalid shared ptr is returned instead."
    },
